\fs36 \cf0 Product characteristics\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Compatible with microcontroller and For Arduino light control board, 3V or 5V signal. High level start, low level stop, PWM speed regulation.\
Widely used to control motor start and stop, solenoid valve and other tributary equipment.\
With optocoupler isolation, control signal and controlled equipment power isolation, greatly improve anti-interference. The signal input side can be welded with terminals or pins, compatible with breadboards. The output can be welded to the terminal or directly welded to the wire.\
The electric PC817 linear optical coupler is capable of transmitting continuously varying analog voltage or current signals.\
There are three sizes of MOS tubes to choose from, LR7843/FR120N/AOD4184.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

